    "rawSections": {
      "HEADER": [
        "Behemoth, Dark (CR 18) [Non-Boss version]",
        "XP 153,600",
        "N Huge Magical Beast",
        "Init +2; Senses Darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision, scent; Perception +21"
      ],
      "DEFENSE": [
        "AC 30, touch 10; flat-footed 28 (+20 natural, +2 dex, -2 size)",
        "hp 362 [475] (25d10+225)",
        "Fort +22, Ref +16, Will +11",
        "DR 10/adamantine; Immune bleed, curse, daze, death effects, nauseating, sickening, stagger, stun; Resist ice/earth/lightning 15, shadow 5;"
      ],
      "OFFENSE": [
        "Speed 40 ft.",
        "Melee 2 Claws +34 (1d10+11), Gore +32 (2d8+11)",
        "Space 15 ft.; Reach 10 ft.",
        "Special Attacks Impale, Magnitude 8, Shockwave, Thunderbolt"
      ],
      "STATISTICS": [
        "Str 32, Dex 14, Con 26, Int 6, Wis 16, Cha 8",
        "Base Atk +25; CMB +38; CMD 50",
        "Feats Alertness, Charge Through, Cleave, Great Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Improved Bull Rush, Improved Natural Attack (Claw and Bite), Improved Overrun, Multiattack, Power Attack, Toughness, Vital Attack",
        "Skills Acrobatics +16, Climb +24, Perception +21, Survival +17",
        "SQ Death befalls Meteor"
      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Death befalls Meteor (su) Once a dark behemoth reaches below 0 health, the dark behemoth calls forth a Meteor (DC 25 Reflex save) on who ever struck the killing blow. If silenced or berserk this affect does nothing.",
        "Impale (ex) When charging, a dark behemoth deals double damage with horns.",
        "Magnitude 8 (su) Once every 1d4 rounds, a dark behemoth can cause the ground to erupt wildly around it within a 60-ft.-radius. Creatures within the area of effect take 15d10 points of earth damage and are inflicted with the Weighted status effect. They must make a successful Reflex save (DC 25) to reduce the damage by half and negate the status effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as an 8th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 31).",
        "Shockwave (su) Once every 1d3 rounds, a dark behemoth can cause the ground to quake that ripples from it within a 30-ft.-radius spread. Creatures within the area of effect take 8d6 points of earth damage, inflicted with the Weighted status effect for 1d6 rounds, and are pushed back 5 feet per 10 damage sustained. A successful Reflex save (DC 25) reduces damage by half, negates the status effect, and stops being pushed back. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 23).",
        "Thunderbolt (su) Once every 1d3 rounds, a dark behemoth can discharge a large lightning storm within 120 ft. and in a 40-ft.-radius. Creatures within the area of effect take 10d6 points of lightning damage and are inflicted with Static status effect for 1d4 rounds. A successful Reflex save (DC 25) reduces the damage by half and negates the status effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 5th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 25)."
      ]
    },
